Privacy Policy for Wa Whisper - Direct Chat & Log

Effective Date: May 10, 2025

Welcome to Wa Whisper - Direct Chat & Log ("we," "us," or "our"). We are committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how Wa Whisper - Direct Chat & Log (the "App") handles information.

By downloading, installing, or using the App, you agree to the terms of this Privacy Policy.

1. Information We Do NOT Collect or Transmit

Wa Whisper is designed with your privacy as a priority. The App does not collect, store (on external servers), transmit, or share any personal information that can identify you. Specifically:

We do not collect your name, email address, phone number (other than the ones you input to send messages), location, or any other personal identifiers.
We do not access your device's contact list for any purpose other than what is implicitly required by WhatsApp when you initiate a chat (the App itself does not read or store your existing contacts).
We do not read or store the content of the WhatsApp messages you send. The App facilitates opening a chat in WhatsApp; the message content is handled by WhatsApp according to their privacy policy.
We do not transmit any of the information you input into the App (phone numbers for sending messages) or the logs generated by the App to our servers or any third-party servers.
2. Information Handled Locally on Your Device

The core functionality of Wa Whisper includes allowing you to send WhatsApp messages without saving the recipient's number to your device's main contact list and keeping a local log of these interactions.

Phone Numbers You Enter: To send a WhatsApp message, you will manually enter the recipient's phone number into the App. This number is used solely to initiate a chat with that number via the WhatsApp application installed on your device.
Locally Stored Chat Logs (SQLite Database): The App creates and stores a log on your device's local storage using an SQLite database. This log contains:
The phone number to whom you initiated a WhatsApp message via the App.
The date and time at which you initiated the message via the App.
This log is stored exclusively on your device and is not transmitted, shared, or accessed by us or any third party. Its purpose is solely for your reference within the App, allowing you to check whom you sent messages to and when.
3. How We Use Information (Locally Stored Data)

The information handled by the App is used for the following purposes only:

To Provide App Functionality:
To enable you to initiate WhatsApp chats with phone numbers without saving them to your device's primary contacts.
To create and display a log of these initiated chats (recipient number and timestamp) for your personal reference within the App.
To Maintain and Improve the App (No Personal Data Involved): We may collect anonymous, aggregated usage statistics that are not tied to any individual user or device to understand how the App is used and to improve its functionality and user experience. This data is fully anonymized and cannot be used to identify you. (You can choose to make this more explicit if you use any such analytics, e.g., "We do not currently use any analytics tools that collect usage statistics").
4. Data Storage and Security (Locally Stored Data)

The chat logs (recipient phone number and timestamp) are stored in an SQLite database located in the App's private internal storage on your device.
This data is subject to your device's own security measures (e.g., screen lock, encryption if enabled on your device).
We do not implement additional encryption on the SQLite database beyond what the operating system may provide for app-private directories, as no highly sensitive personal information (like message content or financial data) is stored. The primary information stored is the phone number you messaged and the timestamp.
5. Data Sharing and Disclosure

Since the App does not collect or transmit personal information from your device, and the chat logs are stored locally:

We do not share or sell any of your information (because we don't collect it remotely).
The locally stored chat logs are not accessible to us or any third parties through the App.
The App interacts with the official WhatsApp application installed on your device to open chats. Your interactions within WhatsApp are governed by WhatsApp's Privacy Policy. Wa Whisper is merely a tool to initiate these chats without saving contacts beforehand.
6. User Control and Data Deletion (Locally Stored Data)

You have control over the locally stored chat logs.
You can clear the chat logs stored by Wa Whisper at any time from within the App's settings or designated log management screen.
Uninstalling the App will also remove its private data, including the locally stored SQLite database containing the chat logs, from your device.
7. Third-Party Services

The App functions as a utility to interact with WhatsApp. WhatsApp is a third-party service with its own Privacy Policy and Terms of Service. Wa Whisper is not affiliated with, endorsed, or sponsored by WhatsApp Inc. or Meta Platforms, Inc. We are not responsible for the data handling practices of WhatsApp. We encourage you to review WhatsApp's Privacy Policy.

The App itself does not integrate any other third-party services that would collect personal information from you (e.g., third-party analytics, advertising networks).

8. Children's Privacy

Wa Whisper is not intended for use by children under the age of 13 (or the relevant age of consent in your jurisdiction). We do not knowingly collect any information from children. If we become aware that a child has provided us with information, we will take steps to delete such information. If you are a parent or guardian and believe that your child has used the App and provided information, please contact us.   

9. Changes to This Privacy Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes in our practices or for other operational, legal, or regulatory reasons. If we make material changes, we will notify you by posting the new Privacy Policy within the App or on our Google Play Store listing before the changes take effect. You are advised to review this Privacy Policy periodically for any changes. Changes to this Privacy Policy are effective when they are posted.   

Your continued use of the App after any such changes constitutes your acceptance of the new Privacy Policy.

10. Your Consent

By using Wa Whisper - Direct Chat & Log, you consent to the terms outlined in this Privacy Policy regarding the local handling of the data necessary for the App's functionality.

